# Recorded input for the tree view example (widgets/tree.zig, `Example`), at 320 x 240 in the
# default theme: the tree view at x 16, its 30 px rows from y 43.5 (src, core, widgets, docs at
# rest). A depth-1 item's disclosure mark is at x 42..50. Keys are USB HID usage ids: 79 Right,
# 80 Left, 81 Down, 74 Home, 77 End.
# 0: rest: src expanded
frame
viewport 320 240
dt 0.016
pointer 300 225
# 1: hover core's mark
frame
pointer 46 88
# 2: press it
frame
buttons left
# 3: release: core expanded and selected, the tree view focused
frame
buttons
# 4: Down: tree.zig
frame
press 81
# 5: Left on a leaf: up to core
frame
press 80
# 6: Left on an expanded parent: core collapses
frame
press 80
# 7: Down: widgets
frame
press 81
# 8: Right: widgets expands
frame
press 79
# 9: Right: into list.zig
frame
press 79
# 10: End: docs
frame
press 77
# 11: Right: docs expands
frame
press 79
# 12: Home: src
frame
press 74
# 13: Left: src collapses
frame
press 80
